## Lab Diamond Price Comparison: Pear vs Emerald Cut

Lab-grown pear cuts offer outstanding value — especially in the 1ct–2ct range where natural pear prices are steep relative to the practical grade you'd buy.

A lab pear at 1ct IGI D-VVS1 starts at [$1,006](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/26932733?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). The same grade in a natural pear runs over $3,800. Lab delivers the same sparkle and the same bow tie risk at one-quarter the natural price.

The bow tie warning applies equally to lab pear diamonds. Certificate grade doesn't capture bow tie severity whether the stone is natural or lab grown. Always check video.

